                    # Send fragmented message using proper WebSocket frame structure
                    # First frame: TEXT opcode with FIN=0 (not final)
                    # Subsequent frames: CONTINUATION opcode with FIN=0
                    # Last frame: CONTINUATION opcode with FIN=1 (final)
                    
                    # Since websockets library doesn't expose low-level frame building,
                    # we need to use the low-level protocol or build frames manually
